OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRain will
OL,6,Fclear away northeastwards this
OL,7,Fevening. Then the rest of the night
OL,8,Fwill be mainly dry although a few
OL,9,Fshowers across Argyll. Freshening
OL,10,Fwinds in the west later. Patchy ground
OL,11,Ffrost and icy patches in east.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FAfter a dry start showery
OL,14,Frain, briefly heavy, will spread east
OL,15,Ffor a time in the morning. Bright in
OL,16,Fthe afternoon with a few showers
OL,17,Facross Argyll, mainly dry elsewhere.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
