OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FRain
OL,6,Fon Monday and early Tuesday, heavy at
OL,7,Ftimes especially in Southwest, local
OL,8,Fflooding. Bright with a few showers
OL,9,Flater Tuesday and Wednesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
